### recursive removal of the home root
rm -rf /home
>>> SC2114 1:8

### recursive removal of usr among other paths
rm -rf /usr /lib/modules/5.10.0/kernel
>>> SC2114 1:8

### recursive removal of var with a trailing slash
rm -r /var/
>>> SC2114 1:7

### brace expansion reaching etc
rm -rf /{etc,opt}
>>> SC2114 1:8

### non-recursive removal is not flagged
rm -f /etc
>>> none
